MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Snapshot builders were pricing pair.defaultDebtToCoverWei (1e6 USDC) as
debtUsd≈1, causing 26 dust rejects across 4 accounts since restart
(host: 0xf20e @ Base 51765799 logged debtUsd=0.99986806 while on-chain
totalDebtBase=923715 / $0.0092).

- Resolve getUserReservesData + indices + oracle prices (batched) per
  account; choose pair from actual holdings; size debtToCover =
  min(actual debt, close-factor 50%/100% at HF 0.95, collateral*(1+bonus)).
- Never fall back to defaultDebtToCoverWei: log debt_to_cover_resolve_failed
  or pair_not_held_skip and skip the candidate.
- Log debtToCover (raw+USD), actualDebtUsd, closeFactorBps, assets on every
  liquidation_evaluated (pass or fail).
- Replay fixture for 0xf20e @ 51765799 (archive eth_call) + unit coverage.
